		<title type="html"><![CDATA[jointure externe postgres ?]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=4117#p4117"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour <br />j&#039;arrive pas a faire une jointure externe de id_parc1,id_parc2<br />merci </p><p>select id_parc2,p1.nblog1990,p2.nblog2006 from<br />( <br />select id_parc as id_parc1 ,count(*)&#160; as nblog1990 <br />from bat&#160; p1 <br />where dte in (&#039;1&#039;,&#039;2&#039;) and ja &lt; &#039;1991&#039; or ja is null<br />and id_parc =&#039;04049AL1080&#039;<br />group by id_parc<br />)p1<br />,<br />( <br />select id_parc as id_parc2 ,count(*)&#160; as nblog2006<br />from bat p1 <br />where dte in (&#039;1&#039;,&#039;2&#039;) and id_parc =&#039;04049AL1080&#039;<br />group by id_parc<br />)p2<br />where <br />( id_parc1 =&#160; id_parc2);</p>]]></content>
